{"id": "6th-t1-u2-008", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-6th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-01-edhilikkuruvigal", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-edhili-bookback", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீட்டு வினா: கூடு கட்டுவதற்கு மரம் கிடைக்காத பறவைகள் ____________ வேறிடம் சென்றன.\nஅ) பதிலிகளாக\nஆ) விருந்தாளிகளாக\nஇ) பயணிகளாக\nஈ) ஏதிலிகளாக", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ", "B": "ஆ", "C": "இ", "D": "ஈ"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் மதிப்பீடு பக்கம் 21-ல்: 'கூடு கட்டுவதற்கு மரம் கிடைக்காத பறவைகள் ஏதிலிகளாக வேறிடம் சென்றன' என்று உள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Textbook evaluation question: Birds that found no trees to build nests migrated elsewhere as ____________:\nA) Replacements (Padh生产者)\nB) Guests (Virundhaligal)\nC) Travelers (Payanigal)\nD) Refugees (Edhiligal)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A", "B": "B", "C": "C", "D": "D"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 21: Birds without trees migrated as 'Edhiligal' (Refugees)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": false, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "textbook", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025",